      "end": 154,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "In Re: An application for bail under\nSection 439 of the Code of Criminal Procedure filed on 12.04.2023 in connection with Bharatpur\nPolice Station Case No.231 of 2022 dated 28.07.2022 under Sections 498A/325/326/307/34 of the\nIndian Penal Code and subsequently charge sheet submitted under Sections 498A/302/34 of the\nIndian Penal Code.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 155,
      "end": 491,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "(G.R. Case No.1267 of 2022)",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 492,
      "end": 519,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "And In Re: Dulal Dey @ Dulal Chandra Dey ... ...\nPetitioner Md. Jannat-ul-Firdous ... ... for the petitioner Mr. Saswata Gopal Mukherjee .. ld.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 520,
      "end": 663,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dulal Dey @ Dulal Chandra Dey",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 531,
          "end": 560
        },
        {
          "text": "Md. Jannat-ul-Firdous",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 580,
          "end": 601
        },
        {
          "text": "Saswata Gopal Mukherjee",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 633,
          "end": 656
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Public\nProsecutor Mr. Aniket Mitra ... ... for the State",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 664,
      "end": 720,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aniket Mitra",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 686,
          "end": 698
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "It is submitted on behalf of the petitioner that he is a physically challenged person.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 721,
      "end": 808,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Allegation of pouring kerosene oil and setting the wife on fire is patently absurd.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 809,
      "end": 892,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Accordingly, he prays for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 893,
      "end": 924,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Learned Advocate for the State opposes the prayer for bail and refers to the dying declaration of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 925,
      "end": 1035,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "We have considered the materials on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1036,
      "end": 1080,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Victim in her dying declaration implicated the petitioner in the crime.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1081,
      "end": 1152,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "His bail prayer was rejected earlier on merits.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1153,
      "end": 1200,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "We are of the prima facie view extent of his physical disability does not wholly rule out the involvement of the petitioner in the crime.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1201,
      "end": 1338,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6284160614013672
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Under such circumstances and in view of gravity of the offence, we are not inclined to grant bail to the petitioner at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1339,
      "end": 1469,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23786833882331848
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The application for bail is thus rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1470,
      "end": 1513,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.224166139960289
    },
